WEBVTT

NOTE
The Lunar Base is destroyed in the Lunar Cry.
Duration: approximately 15 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Green-lit corridors of the Lunar Base flash past.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.780
The ring station, wrapped in red energy, erupts into fiery explosions.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.480
It tears apart, debris scattering into the void.
